# Writer 11 (tally 2.1, 2.1-9, 2.1-20). L §5.10: of q is "refused at a place that keeps no labels of q's sort, a party at
# a place only batched or a batch at one only owned (RUN-DOMAIN, or LOAD-PARTS where load sees the place's kind and q's
# kind)"; L §8.3 `of <q> at <x>, which keeps no labels of its sort`.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind persons: parties
kind couples: parties
kind lots: place PLN min 0
  batched
  step minor(PLN)
  takes k for w order k.batch.day
place konto: lots lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place shop: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input b1_day: date
input b1_amt: money PLN
move b1: transfers
  on b1_day
  leg cash from world to konto amount b1_amt
ask q: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) of ania

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  persons + [ania] lives 1980-01-01..
  persons + [tomek] lives 1981-01-01..
  couples + [ania_tomek] lives 2010-06-01..
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  b1_day = 2026-02-01
  b1_amt = 100.00 PLN
=== expect
refused: LOAD-PARTS of ania at konto, which keeps no labels of its sort ...
